- At very low \( NRe \), the pressure drop is proportional to \( NRe \).  
- As \( NRe \) increases, the pressure drop becomes proportional to \( NRe \).  
- The pressure drop is also influenced by the void ratio (\(\epsilon\)) and the particle density (\(m\)).  

